1310	{"artifactId":"BUILD-7c255f612a40e0eb-s1","entry":{"id":"d6dc6526","text":"Code review CR-7c255f612a40e0eb-s1 (warn, degraded grounding): MED at scope.ts:41 ACCEPTED WITH NOTE (stakeholder decision 2026-10-13). On every code or docs turn of insrc_analyze_step the not-indexed check reads the repository's entities through listEntitiesForRepo, which decodes the whole entity table: measured about 200 ms per turn on an 84,000-entity store (37,000 for the repository), 0 ms for an unregistered path. The analyze run already pays the same cost per plan task through resolveTaskScope. The real fix is ISSUE-61045de9 (the store has no index of entities by repository), which removes the full scan for every caller; the step tool's per-turn call is added there as evidence. The four LOW findings (test-local optional props without '| undefined', hand-written fixture entity ids, one extra blank line in task-scope.ts, coverage unverified by the review but run by the gate: 4/4 pass) are accepted as they stand.","actor":{"id":"legacy:subho-insors-io-decision-recorded-by-the-controller","kind":"person","properties":{"name":"subho@insors.io (decision, recorded by the controller)"}},"timestamp":"2026-10-13T17:15:47.298Z","feedback":[],"kind":"comment","anchor":{"section":"src/daemon/steps/analyze-step/scope.ts"}}}
